{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_009rit02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_009rit02_title", "source_sha256": "df58f38acefe4eef1b118aa565f67baab0dbfed808168326494d0b4ac5cfdb16", "ja": "律子とおでかけ2", "zh": "和律子外出2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_009rit02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_009rit02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4c8eac4f2e8534c969e1873747cbfe3bfe706e5eba6d777f29494bb210f56130", "ja": "律子とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是与律子外出的片段。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_009rit02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_009rit02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f95dbf83fbbf44f945e653f3b20c771f01ce677b0908588f433d292c3c5c2bf3", "ja": "（空き時間に、律子と一緒に水族館を訪れた。\n水槽でできたトンネル、迫力があるな……！）", "zh": "（趁着空闲时间，和律子一起去了水族馆。\n水槽组成的隧道，真有气势啊……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_009rit02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_009rit02_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "211a1b07f56a1503c4f17aa043ee73e07f8008558033d408530f1759dd798cf7", "ja": "なんだか、海の中をそのまま歩いてるみたいな……\n不思議な景色ですね。", "zh": "总觉得就像直接走在海底一样……\n真是不可思议的景色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_009rit02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_009rit02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c23bcb9e95c4dcd6772f962d607cc8c7d510246b4bd5244f878c41eb940369f0", "ja": "確かに、すごいな。あれはカツオ、\nこっちはサンマか……どれも美味しそうだな。", "zh": "确实，太厉害了。那边是鲣鱼，这边是秋刀鱼……每条看起来都好好吃啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_009rit02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_009rit02_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "2a3e4b28596868a378b15a48399104adfdb0f1a35c9e2105a9244b82a2dda7ef", "ja": "{$P$}……ここは水族館ですよ？\nもうすこし、ロマンチックなこと言えないんですか？", "zh": "{$P$}……这里可是水族馆啊？\n就不能说点更浪漫的话吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_009rit02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_009rit02_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "7fcc8c2165e199ff092da5f62d197786c29f4879f51fcc5c3315381219b564af", "ja": "私が言ってほしいとかじゃなくて、ですよ？\nTPOというか……。", "zh": "我不是说我想让你说什么，明白吗？\n只是要看场合……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_009rit02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_009rit02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "e605b0d380cfaaac12286ed96ad270b9ebd895f735ecef0abbdf0f5aefd56e62", "ja": "ロマンチックな事か……えーっと。", "zh": "浪漫的事啊……呃——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_009rit02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_009rit02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "3f8e130a5e0f3cb6ce741a2021a4306bad01f4c1ee7b34847475940a09376f33", "ja": "……君と一緒に……お寿司を食べたい。\nま……回らないやつ……！", "zh": "……想和你一起……去吃寿司。\n不……不是回转的那种……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_009rit02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_009rit02_1007_009rit", "source_sha256": "3ef607ca163486d9fd24d38f2bd6e1bc61dbe576569971668c0a17744c85b203", "ja": "……ぷっ。あはは！　もう……\n{$P$}ってば、なんですか？　それ！", "zh": "……噗。啊哈哈！真是的……\n我说{$P$}，那算什么呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_009rit02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_009rit02_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "d654b7da0017ae9f15efd579980b29abb071a7ea5999fff748735a033a5c92ba", "ja": "まあでも、たしかに回らないお寿司には\nロマンがあるかもしれませんね。……ふふっ。", "zh": "不过，确实，顶级寿司店或许也有其浪漫之处吧……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_009rit02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_009rit02_1009_009rit", "source_sha256": "07afbdc3b9885a6171acc206418c0e17ac5ab688edc3961f8ad51c47be25dd2b", "ja": "もちろん、このあと連れてってくれるんですよね？\n{$P$}殿♪", "zh": "当然，等一下你会带我去的对吧？\n{$P$}阁下♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_009rit02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_009rit02_1010_p", "source_sha256": "8e675d4bd700c9f74506da3ba3d4e60d9733b90657ebcd835d43f67cf488aff0", "ja": "（水族館の後は、美味しいお寿司を堪能した。\n律子はその間ずっと、笑いをこらえていた……）", "zh": "（水族馆之后，我们尽情享用了美味的寿司。在那期间，律子一直忍着笑……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
